  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「汚れたから取り替えるなんて、できないさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「でも、せめて汚れたところを洗ってあげたくて——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「その間だけでも、ダニエルを預かりたいんですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「木之下さん、ぜんぜんダニエルから離れないんですよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「だから、ダニエルそっくりのぬいぐるみを美術部に頼んでつくってもらったんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「それと一時的に入れ替えて、本物のダニエルを染み抜きとかして洗おうと思って」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「でも、美術部にダニエルのおおきさを伝えるのを忘れてて——」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「なんか、やけに巨大なのが届いちゃったんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ふむ。ぬいぐるみというより着ぐるみだね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「おお、後ろにジッパーもついてるぞ。着れるんじゃないかな、これ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
